*R QuickDraw Source/GrafTypes.a supplies the stack query macro.
*R HeapEnd names the original $114 operand.

        MACRO
        _StackAvail
        MOVE.L SP,D0
        SUB.L HeapEnd,D0
        ENDM

*R QuickDraw/Classic/GrafTypes.m.a supplies these trap macros.

		MACRO			
		_MLongMul
		DC.W	($A867)
		ENDM

		MACRO		
		_MFixMul
		DC.W	($A868)
		ENDM

		MACRO			
		_MFixRatio
		DC.W	($A869)
		ENDM

		MACRO			
		_MSysError
		DC.W	($A9C9)
		ENDM

		MACRO				
		_GetScrnBits
		DC.W	($A833) 					;new trap number
		ENDM
